---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Scavland 10 Factions & Reputation Guide — Scavland Wiki" description="Detailed guide to all 10 factions in Scavland: faction territories, vendor inventories, reputation mechanics, hostile triggers, and contract rewards in Zalesye." keywords="Scavland factions, wasteland factions, reputation system, faction vendors, Gunner faction, Mudlark faction, Scavland wiki" canonical="/factions/">
  <article class="article-layout">
    <header class="guide-header">
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="badge official">FACTION DIRECTORY</span>
        <time datetime="2026-08-31">Updated August 31, 2026</time>
      </div>
      <h1>Scavland 10 Factions &amp; Reputation Guide</h1>
      <p class="lede">Complete directory of all 10 survivor organizations competing for dominance across Zalesye: territories, specialized merchants, alignment conflicts, and contract jobs.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="media-strip" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0;">
      <figure style="margin:0;">
        <img src="/images/screenshots/steam_ss_04.jpg" alt="Neutral settlement safehouse and faction outpost in Scavland" style="width:100%;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy"/>
        <figcaption style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-muted,#aaa);margin-top:0.35rem;">Neutral survivor settlement safehouse and trading stalls</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure style="margin:0;">
        <img src="/images/screenshots/steam_ss_13.jpg" alt="Armed faction checkpoint in Zalesye" style="width:100%;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy"/>
        <figcaption style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-muted,#aaa);margin-top:0.35rem;">Fortified checkpoint manned by armed faction sentries</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="note" style="margin-bottom:2rem;background:var(--card-bg,#161616);border:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);padding:1.25rem;border-radius:8px;">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.5rem 0;color:var(--accent,#ffaa00);">Reputation Dynamics &amp; Vendor Standings</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-muted,#ccc);">In Scavland, neutrality is hard to maintain. Assisting one faction by completing high-risk contracts or turning in recovered Soviet technology will increase your loyalty tier with that group while antagonizing their rivals.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Major Factions Directory</h2>

      <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin:1.5rem 0;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;font-size:0.9rem;">
          <thead>
            <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid var(--border-color,#444);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);">
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;">Faction Name</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;">Territory &amp; Base</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;">Attitude</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;">Exclusive Goods &amp; Services</th>
              <th style="padding:0.75rem;">Rival Group</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color,#2a2a2a);">
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent,#ffaa00);">The Free Vultures</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Crossroads Settlement</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;"><span style="color:#00ffaa;">Neutral</span></td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Basic ammo, lockpicks, food/water, stash renting</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Marshland Marauders</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color,#2a2a2a);">
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent,#ffaa00);">Bunker Wardens</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Subterranean Complex 04</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;"><span style="color:#ffaa00;">Guarded</span></td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Heavy body armor, 5.45mm military ammo, night-vision</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Rada Outlaws</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color,#2a2a2a);">
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent,#ffaa00);">Mist Ecologists (Sci-Division)</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Mobile Lab Sector B</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;"><span style="color:#00ffaa;">Neutral</span></td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Anomaly Scanners, high-grade filters, Anti-Rad injectors</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Zealot Cults</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color,#2a2a2a);">
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent,#ffaa00);">The Gunners Syndicate</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Industrial Train Depot</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;"><span style="color:#ffaa00;">Mercenary</span></td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Gun parts, suppressors, high-caliber sniper rifles</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Mudlarks</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color,#2a2a2a);">
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent,#ffaa00);">The Mudlarks</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Sunken Swamplands</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;"><span style="color:#ffaa00;">Cautious</span></td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Swamp herbs, medical salves, improvised stealth cloaks</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Gunners</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color,#2a2a2a);">
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent,#ffaa00);">Marshland Marauders</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Highway Blockade Camps</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;"><span style="color:#ff4444;">Hostile</span></td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">Black-market weapons, stolen military crates (Raid target)</td>
              <td style="padding:0.75rem;">All Factions</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2>How Reputation Tiers Work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Tier 1 — Stranger (0–200 Rep):</strong> Access to basic goods and baseline pricing (100% price index).</li>
        <li><strong>Tier 2 — Associate (200–600 Rep):</strong> 10% discount on ammunition and food; unlocks Tier-2 side contracts and regional safehouse access.</li>
        <li><strong>Tier 3 — Trusted Ally (600–1200 Rep):</strong> 20% discount; unlocks military-grade weapon blueprints, rare attachment crates, and AI guard reinforcement in combat.</li>
        <li><strong>Hostile (&lt; -300 Rep):</strong> Sentries open fire on sight; bounty hunters will ambush you on open roads.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <footer class="guide-footer" style="margin-top:3rem;padding-top:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;">
      <a class="button secondary" href="/weapons/">Weapons Database →</a>
      <a class="button" href="/maps/">Explore Map &amp; Bunkers →</a>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>
